      "explanation": "Degenerate orbitals means orbitals of equal energy.\n<br><br>Cr<sup>3+</sup> forms an\noctahedral inner orbitals complex and its d orbital get splitted into two differnt energy level.\n<br><br>The two set of degenerate orbitals are \n<br><br>(1) d<sub>xy</sub>, d<sub>yz</sub> and\nd<sub>xz</sub>\n<br><br>(2) d<sub>x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup></sub> and d<sub>z<sup>2</sup></sub>"
